{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(4) L=2: untwisting the FSoV norm\n\nGoal: a closed formula for the `L=2` FSoV norm `B` (eq. (12) of arXiv:2603.26617,\nBargheer-Bercini-Lefundes-Ryan) in terms of **untwisted** Q-functions.\n\nStrategy is a **staged** untwisting. With the LR-symmetric twist branch\n`z1 z4 = z2 z3 = 1` and `Q^4 = Q1`, `Q^3 = Q2`, every entry of the 8x8 matrix is a\nproduct `Qi Qj` with `i,j` in `{1,2}`, so only three twist exponentials occur:\n\n| block | `Q1 Q1` | `Q1 Q2` | `Q2 Q2` |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| exponential | `e^(2 phi1 u)` | `e^((phi1+phi2) u)` | `e^(2 phi2 u)` |\n\n- **Step 1** `z1 -> 1` at fixed `z2`: kills the twist in the `Q1 Q1` block only.\n  `Q1` and `Q2` keep distinct exponentials, so they stay independent -- no rotation needed.\n- **Step 2** `z2 -> 1`: `Q1` and `Q2` collide; this is where the gauge rotation\n  `Q2 -> Q2 + r Q1` is required.\n\nSection A ports the twisted Q-solver from `References/SU4_twisted_any_L_Qs.nb`.\nDeliberate deviation from the original: the twist exponential is factored out **by hand**\n(see `BaxP`/`dBaxP`) instead of relying on `PowerExpand`/`Together` to cancel\n`z^(-I u)` factors, and `z1`, `z2` are kept as free algebraic symbols (not `Exp[I phi]`),\nso the whole Baxter system is rational and can be solved **exactly**.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- A1. Conventions of arXiv:2603.26617 ----\n   h = I is the shift unit; theta_alpha = 0 (homogeneous chain).\n   LR-symmetric twist branch: z1 z4 = z2 z3 = 1, so z1 and z2 are the only free twists.\n   Untwisting is z1 -> 1 (step 1) then z2 -> 1 (step 2). *)\nClearAll[h, zz, th, Qth, ThSum, chi, tau, BaxP, dBaxP, solveQsLR, c, J1, J2, J3];\nh = I;\nth[_] := 0;\nzz[3] := 1/zz[2];\nzz[4] := 1/zz[1];\nchi[1] := Sum[zz[i], {i, 4}];\nchi[2] := Sum[zz[i] zz[j], {i, 1, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}];\nchi[3] := Sum[zz[i] zz[j] zz[k], {i, 1, 4}, {j, i + 1, 4}, {k, j + 1, 4}];\nchi[4] := zz[1] zz[2] zz[3] zz[4];\nQth[L_][u_] := Product[u - th[a], {a, L}];\nThSum[L_] := Sum[th[k], {k, L}];\nSimplify /@ {chi[1], chi[2], chi[3], chi[4]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"673673\" data-output-id=\"0\" data-out-n=\"12\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"15\" data-sub-end=\"15\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[12]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"41\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6.0052em;vertical-align:-2.7526em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2526em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.2526em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.7551em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.2526em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.7551em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.7526em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.2526em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.2526em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.7551em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">zz</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><s