  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- A2. Transfer-matrix eigenvalues tau[1], tau[2], tau[3] ----\n   Transcribed verbatim from the reference notebook's set-up cell.\n   {M, S, Nn} are the Bethe-root counts at the three Dynkin nodes; they map to the\n   paper's {K, M, Kbar}, and the Q-degrees are exps = {M, S-M, L+Nn-S, L-Nn}. *)\ntau[1][L_, {M_, S_, Nn_}][u_] := u^L chi[1] +\n   u^(L - 1) ((-h L + h M - ThSum[L]) zz[1] + (-h L - h M + h S - ThSum[L]) zz[2] +\n              (h Nn - h S - ThSum[L]) zz[3] + (-h Nn - ThSum[L]) zz[4]) +\n   Sum[J1[b] u^(b - 1), {b, 1, L - 1}];\n\ntau[2][L_, {M_, S_, Nn_}][u_] := u^(2 L) chi[2] +\n   u^(2 L - 1) ((-3 h L + h S - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[2] +\n                (-2 h L + h M + h Nn - h S - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[3] +\n                (-2 h L - h M + h Nn - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[2] zz[3] +\n                (-2 h L + h M - h Nn - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[4] +\n                (-2 h L - h M - h Nn + h S - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[2] zz[4] +\n                (-h L - h S - 2 ThSum[L]) zz[3] zz[4]) +\n   Sum[J2[b] u^(b - 1), {b, 1, 2 L - 1}];\n\ntau[3][L_, {M_, S_, Nn_}][u_] := u^L chi[3] +\n   u^(L - 1) ((-2 h L + h Nn - ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[2] zz[3] +\n              (-2 h L - h Nn + h S - ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[2] zz[4] +\n              (-h L + h M - h S - ThSum[L]) zz[1] zz[3] zz[4] +\n              (-h L - h M - ThSum[L]) zz[2] zz[3] zz[4]) +\n   Sum[J3[b] u^(b - 1), {b, 1, L - 1}];\n\n{tau[1][2, {0, 1, 0}][u], tau[3][2, {0, 1, 0}][u]} // Simplify",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
