nc242.7,-294.7,395.3,-681.7,458,-1161c21.3,-164.7,33.3,-350.7,36,-558\nl0,-144c-2,-159.3,-10,-310.7,-24,-454c-53.3,-528,-210,-949.7,\n-470,-1265c-4.7,-6,-9.7,-11.7,-15,-17c-0.7,-0.7,-6.7,-1,-18,-1z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎭</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.492em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.016em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.016em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 16\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V16 H384z M384 0 H504 V16 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎬</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.016em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.016em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 16\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V16 H384z M384 0 H504 V16 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎫</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.79em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[16]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{J1\\left(1\\right)+u\\,\\left(\\frac{u}{\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)}+\\left(u-2\\,\\mathrm{i}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)+\\frac{\\left(u-\\mathrm{i}\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)^2+1\\right)}{\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)}\\right) \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,J3\\left(1\\right)+u\\,\\left(\\frac{u-2\\,\\mathrm{i}}{\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)}+\\left(u-4\\,\\mathrm{i}\\right)\\,\\mathrm{zz}\\left(1\\right)+\\frac{\\left(u-3\\,\\mathrm{i}\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)^2+1\\right)}{\\mathrm{zz}\\left(2\\right)}\\right)\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
