  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- A3. Baxter operators, exponential factored out by hand ----\n   Q_i(u) = zz[i]^(-I u) p_i(u)  =>  Q_i(u + a h) = zz[i]^(-I u) * zz[i]^a * p_i(u + a I),\n   so dividing the Baxter equation by zz[i]^(-I u) leaves a polynomial in u.\n   This replaces the reference notebook's PowerExpand/Together/Numerator step. *)\nBaxP[L_, cfg_][z_, p_][u_] :=\n    z^2 p[u + 2 I] Qth[L][u] Qth[L][u - I]\n  + z^(-2) p[u - 2 I] Qth[L][u] Qth[L][u + I] chi[4]\n  - z^1 p[u + I] Qth[L][u - I] tau[1][L, cfg][u + I]\n  + p[u] tau[2][L, cfg][u + I]\n  - z^(-1) p[u - I] Qth[L][u + I] tau[3][L, cfg][u + I];\n\n(* Dual: Q^k(u) = zd^(+I u) pd(u)  =>  Q^k(u + a h) = zd^(I u) * zd^(-a) * pd(u + a I). *)\ndBaxP[L_, cfg_][zd_, p_][u_] :=\n    zd^2 p[u - 2 I] Qth[L][u] Qth[L][u + I]\n  + zd^(-2) p[u + 2 I] Qth[L][u] Qth[L][u - I] chi[4]\n  - zd^1 p[u - I] Qth[L][u + I] tau[1][L, cfg][u]\n  + p[u] tau[2][L, cfg][u + I]\n  - zd^(-1) p[u + I] Qth[L][u - I] tau[3][L, cfg][u + 2 I];\n\nHead /@ {BaxP, dBaxP}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"673673\" data-output-id=\"2\" data-out-n=\"19\" data-sub-idx=\"4\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"19\" data-sub-end=\"19\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[19]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"41\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1xtYXRocm17U3ltYm9sfSxcbWF0aHJte1N5bWJvbH1ccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Symbol</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Symbol</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[19]= \\left\\{\\mathrm{Symbol},\\mathrm{Symbol}\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
