       "data": "Out[34]= \\left\\{1,u+\\frac{\\mathrm{i}\\,\\left(\\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i}\\,ph1}+\\mathrm{e}^{2\\,\\mathrm{i}\\,ph2}\\right)}{\\left(1+\\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i}\\,ph2}\\right)\\,\\left(\\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i}\\,ph1}-\\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i}\\,ph2}\\right)}\\right\\}",
