  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- B2. The 8x8 matrix of eq. (12) and the normalised norm B ---- *)\nClearAll[LL, Qent, rowsIdx, colsIdx, Mmat, Q12f, Bnorm];\nLL = 2;\n\n(* one matrix element <Q_j^[a] u^(beta-1) Q^k[b]>_{L,alpha}, LR symmetry Q^k = Q_(5-k) *)\nQent[alpha_, j_, k_, beta_, a_, b_] := Qent[alpha, j, k, beta, a, b] =\n  Module[{m = 5 - k, f},\n   f = Exp[(ph[j] + ph[m]) u] Exp[I a ph[j]/2] Exp[I b ph[m]/2] *\n       (pph[j] /. u -> u + a I/2) (pph[m] /. u -> u + b I/2) u^(beta - 1);\n   brk[f, LL, alpha]];\n\nrowsIdx = Flatten[Table[{alpha, j, k}, {alpha, LL}, {j, 1, 2}, {k, 3, 4}], 2];\ncolsIdx = Flatten[Table[{beta, a, b}, {beta, LL}, {a, {1, -1}}, {b, {1, -1}}], 2];\n\nMmat = Outer[Qent[#1[[1]], #1[[2]], #1[[3]], #2[[1]], #2[[2]], #2[[3]]] &,\n             rowsIdx, colsIdx, 1];\n\n(* QQ-relation Q12 = Q1^+ Q2^- - Q1^- Q2^+ ; with LR symmetry Q^34 = -Q12 *)\nQ12f[uu_] := Exp[(ph1 + ph2) uu] (\n    Exp[I (ph1 - ph2)/2] (pph[1] /. u -> uu + I/2) (pph[2] /. u -> uu - I/2)\n  - Exp[-I (ph1 - ph2)/2] (pph[1] /. u -> uu - I/2) (pph[2] /. u -> uu + I/2));\n\n(* normalisation (15): each of the 4L rows carries 1/Sqrt[Q12(-i/2)] and 1/Sqrt[Q34(i/2)] *)\nBnorm = Det[Mmat]/(Q12f[-I/2] (-Q12f[I/2]))^(2 LL);\n\n{Dimensions[Mmat], Simplify[Q12f[-I/2]], Simplify[Q12f[I/2]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
