       "data": "Out[53]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{step1 order in phi1}\\to 2 \\\\\n  &,\\text{step2 order in phi2}\\to 4 \\\\\n  &,\\text{rotation r}\\to \\frac{1}{ph2},\\text{Q1hat}\\to 1 \\\\\n  &,\\text{Q2hat}\\to \\frac{1}{6}\\,\\left(3\\,u^2+2\\right),\\text{Q12hat}\\to -\\mathrm{i}\\,u \\\\\n  &,\\text{Bsu2untw (untwisted Qs)}\\to 8 \\\\\n  &,\\text{Bsu2 twisted, phi2->0}\\to 8 \\\\\n  &,\\text{lim B1/phi2\\^{}4}\\to -31.9999791667 \\\\\n  &+0.\\times 10^{-11}\\,\\mathrm{i} \\\\\n  &,\\text{predicted -4*Bsu2untw}\\to -32\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
